Package: ordpp
Type: Package
Title: Projection Pursuit with Monotone Scoring for Ordered Categorical Data
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-10-06
Authors@R: person("Diego Andres", "Perez Ruiz", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "diego.perezruiz@manchester.ac.uk")
Description: Exploratory projection pursuit for ordered categorical
    (ordinal) items. Monotone category scores and a projection direction are
    estimated jointly by maximizing a weighted characteristic-function
    discrepancy between the projected joint distribution and the projection
    implied by item independence with the observed marginal distributions.
    Fitted category dictionaries and loadings can be frozen and evaluated on
    held-out data, with a finite-sample-valid held-out permutation test, a refitted
    permutation test, a variance/shape decomposition of the index and
    bootstrap stability summaries.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, graphics
URL: https://github.com/dapr12/ordpp
BugReports: https://github.com/dapr12/ordpp/issues
